id: pm-swarm-watch
title: Watch live lane status changes
description: Stream TOON blocks or JSON lines for lane and conflict changes with bounded polling and SIGINT shutdown.
type: Feature
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-16T13:15:57.486Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-16T15:55:04.773Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Child-process watch tests observe pushed conflicting commits and graceful shutdown.
parent: pm-swarm-07o2
comments[21]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T13:18:21.789Z",codex-agent,"Design: serial status polling emits only changed lane rows and newly predicted, changed or resolved conflicts; TOON blocks or JSON lines, minimum two seconds, interruptible SIGINT shutdown. No fetch or remote writes."
  "2026-10-16T13:23:50.786Z",codex-agent,"Both real CLI child watchers pass: unchanged polls emit nothing; a committed and pushed branch change emits lane_changed and conflict_predicted naming the source path; JSON lines and decoded TOON blocks agree; SIGINT exits zero."
  "2026-10-16T13:26:27.314Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: restoring only runCommand from the base branch made the JSON child watcher emit a one-shot status instead of watch events; focused test exited 1 (0 pass, 1 fail) waiting for lane_added. Restored implementation. Source imports require no dist rebuild."
  "2026-10-16T13:30:21.031Z",codex-agent,"Shutdown regression found and fixed: the host renders undefined JSON or an empty TOON object when a streaming command returns void. Register renderers scoped to swarm status plus its completion marker; preserve native rendering for ordinary status and every other command. Strengthened child assertions reject trailing non-event records. Final focused suite passes 12/12, including renderer ownership boundaries and pair-order invariance."
  "2026-10-16T13:36:43.765Z",codex-agent,"Strengthened real-push regression: an independent clone creates the conflicting commit; the watched repository stays unchanged and silent before push. Pushing into the watched lane ref emits lane_changed and conflict_predicted. Both TOON and JSON child watchers pass, with zero trailing non-event records and clean SIGINT exits. Focused suite: 12/12."
  "2026-10-16T13:44:01.161Z",codex-agent,"Coverage-run test synchronization correction: wait for fully decoded framed records for both initial lanes, and a complete conflict record, instead of matching partial pipe text. This removes the initial-output race under load. Focused suite passes 12/12 with independent-clone push, silent polls and clean shutdown."
  "2026-10-16T13:57:32.146Z",codex-agent,"Final gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass normally and with CI=1, isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Each run: 93/93 tests plus 1/1 packed npm/native Bun acceptance, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 21 authored source files at 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines. Statements/lines 1337/1337; functions 72/72; branches 601/601 for normal npm and 600/600 for the other runs. Identity, types, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, production audit, package allowlist, changelog and publish attestation pass. Three behavioural revert proofs are recorded. Publication remains maintainer-gated."
  "2026-10-16T14:05:32.050Z",codex-agent,"Round 1: fixing packed project activation by removing the direct TOON runtime dependency and exercising pack, extraction and project-scope directory installation through the real host. Main is already contained in the PR branch. Will verify native watch streaming, a built-import guard and behavioural revert proof before release gates."
  "2026-10-16T14:07:36.538Z",codex-agent,"Pinned SDK inspection: sdk/testing publicly exports encodeToon backed by the host codec, while the command SDK has no streaming renderer service. Watch now uses that SDK export; package.json and the lockfile have zero runtime dependencies. Packed acceptance installs only the pm host, extracts npm pack, installs the extracted directory at project scope, rejects all activation warnings, and checks direct Node/Bun plus npx/bunx commands and TOON/JSON watch children. The built artifact guard rejects non-Node, non-SDK bare imports."
  "2026-10-16T14:12:22.283Z",codex-agent,"Round 1 behavioural revert proof: restoring only the direct watch import from @toon-format/toon (aliasing encode to preserve the unchanged function body), rebuilding and running npm run test:install fails 0/2. The real extracted-directory project installation exits 1 with runtime_activation_status failed and Cannot find package @toon-format/toon; the independent dist import guard reports forbidden runtime import @toon-format/toon. Restored the SDK import and rebuilt. Before the revert, the fixed packed acceptance passed 2/2, including npm/npx and native Bun/bunx, direct host invocation, both watch formats, silent polls, SIGINT shutdown and path privacy."
  "2026-10-16T14:15:00.785Z",codex-agent,"The mandatory pm-linked run exposed inherited PM_SOURCE_WORKSPACE_ROOT/PM_SOURCE_PM_PATH in the existing packed fixture: host commands used the caller workspace for Git operations. Bound source workspace, source tracker and global tracker to scratch consumer context, cleared inherited build leases, injected a decoy source context deliberately, and added an exact returned lane-path assertion. Verified and removed the clean test-created lane, branch and lane config. Package branch and source files were preserved. Rerunning linked tests with the corrected fixture."
  "2026-10-16T14:17:20.668Z",codex-agent,"Final fixture verification: pm test pm-swarm-watch --run --progress passes both linked commands (6/6 watch tests and 2/2 packed acceptance, no skipped tests). Tracker test-result recording is disabled by project policy, so this comment preserves the receipt without changing policy. Repeated the direct-import-only behavioural revert against the final isolated fixture: npm run test:install fails 0/2 with missing-package project activation and forbidden runtime import. Restored SDK import and rebuilt. No test lane, branch or lane config remains in the package repository. Starting all four release gate configurations."
  "2026-10-16T14:30:57.256Z",codex-agent,"Round 1 final gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass normally and with CI=1, fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Every configuration passes 93/93 suite tests plus 2/2 packed acceptance tests, with zero failures, skips, cancellations or todos. All 21 authored source files meet 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines at unchanged thresholds: statements/lines 1337/1337; functions 72/72; branches npm-normal 600/600, bun-normal 601/601, npm-ci 601/601, bun-ci 600/600. Production audit reports zero vulnerabilities; identity, types, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, package allowlist, changelog and publish attestation pass. Linked tests passed 6/6 focused watch plus 2/2 packed acceptance. Final-fixture direct-import revert fails 0/2 as required. No new CLI/SDK defect found; inherited source-context isolation was corrected in the acceptance fixture. Existing development-tool advisory remains separately tracked by pm-swarm-zn7m. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification; item remains in progress."
  "2026-10-16T14:36:19.833Z",codex-agent,"GitHub head 489b26a: Node 26 and CodeQL passed; Node 22 failed in the packed fixture cleanup hook with ENOTEMPTY while recursively removing the scratch Bun cache. Reclaimed the item. Replacing synchronous scratch removal with awaited fs.rm and the same bounded retry policy so concurrent child/cache cleanup can settle. Will validate packed acceptance on the installed Node 22 runtime, rerun final release configurations, commit this fixture correction with tracker history, and monitor the new head. No thread replies or mentions."
  "2026-10-16T14:42:42.329Z",codex-agent,Awaited scratch cleanup now passes packed acceptance 2/2 on Node 22.23.1 with both Bun 1.3.5 and CI-matching Bun 1.4.3. The temporary Bun 1.4.3 runtime does not change the host installation. Revalidating both linked commands and all four release-check configurations with Bun 1.4.3; package runtime code and dependency policy remain unchanged from 489b26a.
  "2026-10-16T14:46:33.179Z",codex-agent,"The Bun 1.4.3 linked run passed watch 6/6, but its packed command hit the runner default 120-second timeout before completion. Standalone Node 22 packed acceptance passed 2/2 in about 153 seconds. Aligned the packed linked-test timeout to the acceptance test existing 600-second budget, preserving every assertion and all coverage thresholds. Rerunning both linked commands with that bounded budget before final gates."
  "2026-10-16T14:48:47.738Z",codex-agent,"Final cleanup fixture passes both pm-linked commands (6/6 watch tests plus 2/2 packed acceptance) with Bun 1.4.3 and the packed test declared 600-second budget. Repeated the direct-import-only revert and rebuilt: 0/2 pass, missing-package activation plus forbidden built import; restored SDK import and rebuilt. Starting the four final release checks."
  "2026-10-16T15:07:15.397Z",codex-agent,"Final cleanup follow-up gates with Bun 1.4.3: npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass normally and with CI=1, fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Each configuration passes 93/93 suite tests and 2/2 packed acceptance tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, and 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across all 21 authored source files at unchanged thresholds. Statements/lines 1337/1337; functions 72/72; branches npm-normal 600/600, bun-normal 600/600, npm-ci 601/601, bun-ci 601/601. Production audit, identity, types, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, package contents, changelog and publish attestation pass. Both pm-linked commands pass (6/6 watch plus 2/2 packed) using the packed test existing 600-second budget. Final direct-import-only revert fails 0/2 with missing-package activation and forbidden runtime import. Node 22.23.1 packed acceptance passes 2/2 with Bun 1.3.5 and CI-matching 1.4.3. Prior history bytes and runtime implementation remain unchanged from 489b26a; follow-up awaits scratch removal and aligns linked timeout metadata. No new pm CLI/SDK defect identified. Releasing claim, preserving in_progress for orchestrator verification, and pushing for final GitHub checks."
  "2026-10-16T15:31:15.625Z",codex-agent,"Round 2: watch emits a completed-poll heartbeat to stderr only when PM_SWARM_TEST_POLL_HEARTBEAT=1. JSON and TOON integration checks observe two additional completed polls before checking unchanged output and unpushed-commit silence; packed npm and native Bun consumers use the same completion evidence. Removed fixed 2300 ms synchronization delays. Normal output is unchanged."
  "2026-10-16T15:38:03.551Z",codex-agent,The two-poll assertions also wait for the initial poll-complete heartbeat before capturing the marker baseline. This prevents pipe delivery order from counting the initial poll as one of the two later polls. Restarting the release matrix after this final assertion refinement.
  "2026-10-16T15:55:02.000Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 final validation after the initial-heartbeat baseline refinement: pm test pm-swarm-watch --run --progress passed 6/6 focused watch tests and 2/2 packed acceptance tests. npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass normally and with isolated HOME, disabled global/system Git config and CI=1; each passes 97/97 suite tests, 2/2 packed acceptance tests, and 100 percent in all four coverage dimensions across 21 source files. Two later completed polls are required for source and packed silence assertions. Identity, type checks, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, production audit, package contents, generated changelog and publish attestation pass. Will push the combined code/tracker commit and poll GitHub checks every 60 seconds for up to 30 minutes. Leaving status in progress for orchestrator verification."
